gaps.proposedFix:
Add a converter pair operating on List<Text|Bytes> <-> Bytes:
  lvList(u8)    // encode: for each item emit len then bytes
  unlvList(u8)  // decode: consume to end of the enclosing region
Usage — encode: { "value":"inputs.txt | lvList(u8)" }
        decode: { "region":{"length":"capture.rdlength"}, "value":null, "conv":"unlvList(u8)", "as":"txt" }
A converter is the smallest fix and it composes with the `region` field kind rather than duplicating it. Equivalently, permit "t":null in tlvList — but a named converter is clearer and reusable.
